{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinos Falling</strong> is a cooperative 3D platformer for 1\u20133 players (local or online). Take control of clumsy dinosaurs trying to escape a modern city packed with traps, surprises, and hilarious deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rule is simple: <i>\u201cReach the exit and survive.\u201d</i> But every level is full of tricks, unexpected obstacles, and situations where nothing goes as planned. Chaos and laughter are guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels</strong><br>Each stage is handcrafted and offers new traps and challenges. From city streets to rooftops and construction sites \u2014 every setting throws in fresh obstacles and reasons to laugh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong><br>Play together with friends either locally on one screen or online. Cooperation won\u2019t be easy \u2014 sometimes your friend is the biggest trap of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong><br>No two falls are ever the same. Even familiar levels turn into new stories full of randomness, fails, and fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946530?t=1763482316","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946530/a67a258ed2eecaf524ae8b8c70ecd0772e27e9a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763482316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946530/253c4372767ad564cc9e6c234265ab4f28ba3b97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763482316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946530/253c4372767ad564cc9e6c234265ab4f28ba3b97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763482316","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"descripti